<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 12:24:48 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>一种可能克服癌症治疗耐药性的新药</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/a-new-drug-that-can-potentially-overcome-cancer-therapy-resistance</link><description>贝勒医学院的研究人员开发了一种名为 CS18 的药物，可以破坏癌细胞在治疗中存活的能力。研究结果， &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/a-new-drug-that-can-potentially-overcome-cancer-therapy-resistance.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 12:24:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/a-new-drug-that-can-potentially-overcome-cancer-therapy-resistance</guid></item><item><title>Steam 上的 Cult Clicker</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/cult-clicker-on-steam</link><description>你是新生的神。收割灵魂，释放致命的力量，并通过打击非信徒来培养忠实的追随者。无论是带有激光眼的霸王龙、炽热的地狱还是仅仅一个猛烈的喷嚏，都必须牺牲灵魂。让收获开始吧！&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/cult-clicker-on-steam2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 12:09:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/cult-clicker-on-steam</guid></item><item><title>杰夫·迪恩 (Jeff Dean) 和其他顶尖人工智能研究人员将离开谷歌，创办自己的初创公司</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/jeff-dean-and-other-top-ai-researchers-are-leaving-google-to-launch-their-own-startup</link><description>这位传奇的谷歌高管与其他即将离任的谷歌高管一起执行一项联合任务，利用人工智能推动科学发现的进程。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/jeff-dean-and-other-top-ai-researchers-are-leaving-google-to-launch-their-own-startup.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 11:54:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/jeff-dean-and-other-top-ai-researchers-are-leaving-google-to-launch-their-own-startup</guid></item><item><title>天文学家在大爆炸后 12 亿年后发现了巨大的星系逐块组装的过程</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/astronomers-catch-massive-galaxy-assembling-piece-by-piece-1-2-billion-years-after-big-bang</link><description>天文学家在大爆炸后仅 12 亿年就发现了由六个年轻星系组成的极其微小的星系团。这可能是对宇宙中一些最大星系如何形成的罕见一睹。概述研究结果的论文已于 7 月 13 日提交给 arXiv 预印本服务器。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/astronomers-catch-massive-galaxy-assembling-piece-by-piece-1-2-billion-years-after-big-bang2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 11:39:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/astronomers-catch-massive-galaxy-assembling-piece-by-piece-1-2-billion-years-after-big-bang</guid></item><item><title>可注射生物材料利用免疫系统促进中风后大脑修复</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/injectable-biomaterial-harnesses-the-immune-system-to-promote-brain-repair-after-a-stroke</link><description>杜克大学的生物医学工程师开发了一种可注射生物材料，有助于将血栓引起的中风后留下的空腔转变为更有利于修复的环境。通过招募人体自身的免疫细胞，该治疗促进了新血管的生长，支持神经重塑并改善了小鼠的运动表现。这项工作发表在《细胞生物材料》杂志上。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/injectable-biomaterial-harnesses-the-immune-system-to-promote-brain-repair-after-a-stroke.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 11:24:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/injectable-biomaterial-harnesses-the-immune-system-to-promote-brain-repair-after-a-stroke</guid></item><item><title>端粒到端粒褐鼠基因组可以锐化疾病研究模型</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/telomere-to-telomere-brown-rat-genome-could-sharpen-disease-research-models</link><description>UTHealth 休斯顿领导的团队表示，研究人员已经创建了迄今为止最完整的褐鼠基因图谱，为科学家更准确地研究与心脏病、肾病、高血压和中风等疾病的遗传联系铺平了道路。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/telomere-to-telomere-brown-rat-genome-could-sharpen-disease-research-models2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 11:09:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/telomere-to-telomere-brown-rat-genome-could-sharpen-disease-research-models</guid></item><item><title>科学家试图将光子切成两半，打破了物理规则</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/scientists-tried-to-cut-a-photon-in-halfand-broke-the-rules-of-physics</link><description>新的研究表明，切割单个光粒子会产生无限远的光子。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scientists-tried-to-cut-a-photon-in-halfand-broke-the-rules-of-physics.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 10:54:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/scientists-tried-to-cut-a-photon-in-halfand-broke-the-rules-of-physics</guid></item><item><title>如果大脑不创造意识怎么办？科学家提出它可能是现实本身的结构</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/what-if-the-brain-doesnt-create-consciousness-scientist-proposes-it-might-be-the-fabric-of-reality-itself</link><description>几十年来，神经科学家&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/what-if-the-brain-doesnt-create-consciousness-scientist-proposes-it-might-be-the-fabric-of-reality-itself.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 10:39:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/what-if-the-brain-doesnt-create-consciousness-scientist-proposes-it-might-be-the-fabric-of-reality-itself</guid></item><item><title>台积电和研究人员在芯片晶体管技术方面取得重大突破，推动亚 1 纳米技术的发展</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/tsmc-researchers-make-big-breakthrough-in-chip-transistor-technology-as-part-of-push-towards-developing-sub-1-nanometer-technologies</link><description>诀窍是：二硫化钼上的超薄铝缓冲器可以抑制 FinFET 和 GAAFET 击穿时的电子泄漏。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/tsmc-researchers-make-big-breakthrough-in-chip-transistor-technology-as-part-of-push-towards-developing-sub-1-nanometer-technologies.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 10:24:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/tsmc-researchers-make-big-breakthrough-in-chip-transistor-technology-as-part-of-push-towards-developing-sub-1-nanometer-technologies</guid></item><item><title>一罐封存在公元前 1000 年左右埃及坟墓内的蜂蜜在 20 世纪被考古学家打开，发现仍然可以食用</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/a-jar-of-honey-sealed-inside-an-egyptian-tomb-around-1000-bce-was-opened-by-archaeologists-in-the-20th-century-and-found-still-edible</link><description>据报道，来自古埃及墓葬环境的密封蜂蜜在数千年后仍然可以食用——这一说法的具体实例很难找到，但其潜在的化学成分（由低含水量、酸性 pH 值和蜜蜂产生的过氧化氢驱动）是真实且有据可查的。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/a-jar-of-honey-sealed-inside-an-egyptian-tomb-around-1000-bce-was-opened-by-archaeologists-in-the-20th-century-and-found-still-edible.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 10:09:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/a-jar-of-honey-sealed-inside-an-egyptian-tomb-around-1000-bce-was-opened-by-archaeologists-in-the-20th-century-and-found-still-edible</guid></item></channel></rss>